  "bodyHash": "krOqpU3ZBCg=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Fabric\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Forge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"NeoForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Neo Forge-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/899742852681191444?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=&amp;labelColor=231C25&amp;color=5c2a21\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fobscure-tooltips-media-kit-VPpfjxP\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"媒体工具包\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/获取媒体工具包-5c4521?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=imgur&amp;labelColor=251C20&amp;logoColor=white\"></a>\n</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">Obscure Tooltips 是一款客户端视觉增强模组，能将普通的物品提示框转变为富有表现力的动画展示。它通过引入流畅的动画、动态粒子效果以及根据物品稀有度和环境自适应的装饰性边框，为你的物品栏增添沉浸式的视觉魅力。</h2><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img width=\"90%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2Rn2RuE.png\"></p><p><br></p><div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BUUrpIP.gif\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">动画提示框</h1>\n        <p>流畅的动画、发光边框和细腻的粒子效果，让每个提示框都栩栩如生。多种样式支持丰富的视觉表现——从动画装饰到分层效果——让每件物品都显得独特且富有表现力。</p>\n    </div>\n</div><p><br>\n</p><hr><br><p></p><div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">集成模型</h1>\n        <p>直接在提示框内查看任何护甲、工具或武器的完整3D模型。无需装备或打开额外菜单，即可即时预览装备。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nhHUKgM.jpeg\" width=\"60%\">\n</div><p><br>\n</p><hr><br><p></p><div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/E9yChOe.gif\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">平滑滚动</h1>\n        <p>当提示框超出屏幕高度时，自动触发平滑滚动，保持文字可读且不显杂乱。让你无需调整UI即可自然阅读长描述。</p>\n    </div>\n</div><p><br>\n</p><hr><br><p></p><div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">自动换行</h1>\n        <p>智能换行功能让宽提示框保持整洁、易读且格式完美。长名称、背景故事和属性值都能整齐排列，不会超出布局。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gUXvCIP.jpeg\" width=\"60%\">\n</div><p><br>\n</p><hr><br><p></p><div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4yIqabL.gif\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">无与伦比的定制性</h1>\n        <p>Obscure Tooltips 是首个引入完全动画化、视觉丰富提示框的模组。尽管此后出现了类似模组，但其模块化、数据驱动的设计依然提供了独特的灵活方式，让你能够<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fobscurialithium.github.io%252fobscure-tooltips%252f%2523tooltip-styles\" rel=\"nofollow\">构建</a>和<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fobscurialithium.github.io%252fobscure-tooltips%252f%2523style-merging-fallback\" rel=\"nofollow\">合并样式</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fobscurialithium.github.io%252fobscure-tooltips%252f%2523tooltip-filters\" rel=\"nofollow\">创建条件</a>，以及<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fobscurialithium.github.io%252fobscure-tooltips%252f%2523core-concept\" rel=\"nofollow\">自定义每个元素</a>，以契合你的愿景。</p>\n    </div>\n</div><p><br>\n<br></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img width=\"90%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2zmjwZJ.png\"></p><p><br></p><h2>游戏内配置</h2><p>在 Minecraft 1.20.1 版本中，使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge Config Screens</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configured</a> 模组即可获得游戏内配置菜单。若未安装这些模组，所有设置仍可通过配置文件调整（路径：<em>config/obscuria/obscure_tooltips-client.toml</em>）。从 Minecraft 1.21.1 版本起，游戏内配置界面将原生可用，无需额外依赖。</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img width=\"90%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5ZBaOT4.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AWVa1rL.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K0F3Uyq.png\" width=\"45%\"></a>\n</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pillager-caravans\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lPK6BrB.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elixirum\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zMZKr3b.png\" width=\"45%\"></a>\n</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accents\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/quXJZzx.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rjJSLI0.png\" width=\"45%\">\n</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Obscuria\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4lV9g9R.png\" width=\"90%\"></a>\n</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Y7y8mO.png\" width=\"90%\"></a>\n</p>",
